{"id":"prinzip","lemma":"Prinzip","pos":"noun","rank":3191,"glosses":["principle"],"ipa":"/pʁɪnˈtsiːp/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d7/De-Prinzip.ogg/De-Prinzip.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Prinzips","plural":"Prinzipien"},"examples":[{"text":"Das geht gegen meine Prinzipien.","en":"That runs against my principles.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Es ist im Prinzip egal, was du willst.","en":"What you want doesn't really matter.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"no matter"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"}]},{"text":"Tom hat keine Prinzipien.","en":"Tom has no principles.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756966","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Er hält an seinen Prinzipien fest.","en":"He sticks to his principles.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to hold","l":"halten"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"firm"}]},{"text":"Ich frage aus Prinzip keine Frau nach ihrem Alter.","en":"I make it a rule never to ask a woman how old she is.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"question"},{"g":"out of / from"},null,{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"woman"},{"g":"after / to"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},{"g":"age, old age"}]}]}